        "snippet": "Glenbrook Capital Management Purchases 35,000 Shares of Senestech (NASDAQ:SNES) Stock - The Lincolnian Online\n\n# Glenbrook Capital Management Purchases 35,000 Shares of Senestech (NASDAQ:SNES) Stock\n\nPosted by Alanna Baker on Jul 2nd, 2026\n\nShare on Twitter Share on Facebook Share on LinkedIn Share on Stocktwits\n\nSenestech, Inc. (NASDAQ:SNES– Get Free Report) major shareholder Glenbrook Capital Management bought 35,000 shares of the stock in a transaction that occurred on Tuesday, June 30th. The shares were purchased at an average cost of $1.51 per share, with a total value of $52,850.00. Following the purchase, the insider directly owned 1,022,824 shares of the company’s stock, valued at $1,544,464.24. The trade was a 3.54% increase in their ownership of the stock. The acquisition was disclosed in a document filed with the SEC, which is available through the SEC website. Major shareholders that own more than 10% of a company’s shares are required to disclose their sales and purchases ",
